{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1448581-bastet-conficting-beginning-gnosis","id":1448581,"title":"Bastet conficting beginning Gnosis","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-15T06:48:56-07:00","id":1448581,"title":"Bastet conficting beginning Gnosis","content":"The Breedbook , PG 1st edition, PG 2nd edition, W20 makes them begin with an extra Permanent Gnosis point, but PG to the CB and CB20 makes them as the Garou (1 for homids, 3 for metis and 5 for feline). My players are arguing which is the &quot;official&quot;, the Ajaba have a similar situation between W20 and CB20, what to do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1876,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1876-fenixpp","user":"Fenixpp","date":". 05-15-2021, 09:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1876-fenixpp","name":"Fenixpp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1876_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-15T13:50:18-07:00","id":1448618,"title":"","content":"Without an official answer?<br /> <br /> My approach is to treat the +1 Gnosis as a condensed version for werewolf focused games, and the more detailed spread for Bastet or mix-Fera focused games.<br /> <br /> This is mostly because of the books in question. With the outlier of the Breedbook, the books with the +1 Gnosis thing are all werewolf-focused books with short summaries of the Fera with enough meat on them to include them in a game, but not really the depth we know they're capable of having. The Revised and 20th CB books are for having fully fleshed out Fera games.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-16T10:01:40-07:00","id":1448701,"title":"","content":"I see... I decided with a compromise while I was in session last time. CB20 has a merit of 7pts to indicate the Bastet has the &quot;knack for magic&quot; as it was described in the PG2nd, if they purchase this merit they can have the additional Gnosis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1876-fenixpp","name":"Fenixpp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1876_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-16T19:30:04-07:00","id":1448743,"title":"","content":"&quot;Why don't you just pay two more points to buy another dot of Gnosis?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;But... it goes to eleven!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;But it doesn't...&quot;<br /> <br /> Edit in Non-Shitpost component: The Bastet Gnosis bump always struck me as akin to the Appearance boost that some of them used to have in near-human; an affectation of an author that liked their creations a bit too much, and gave them extra stuff or made their nightmarish monster forms pretty and neat accordingly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","user":"Saur Ops Specialist","date":". 05-16-2021, 10:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}